HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8
Content-Length: 8759
Cache-Control: no-store
Connection: close
X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
Referrer-Policy: same-origin
Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'none'

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="color-scheme" content="dark"><meta name="darkreader-lock"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Control</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"><link rel='stylesheet' href='/collective.css'><link rel='stylesheet' href='/runtime.css'><link rel='stylesheet' href='/workspace.css'><link rel='stylesheet' href='/navigation.css'></head>
<body>
<aside class="sidebar">
  <a href="/" class="brand"><span class="brand-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌘</span>CONTROL<span class="version">/ 0.1</span></a>
  <div class="workspace"><span class="dot"></span><div>Local workspace<small>control.local</small></div></div>
  <div class="nav-label">WORKSPACE</div>
  <nav aria-label="Workspace"><a href='/dms'><span aria-hidden='true'>⌁</span><span>DMs</span></a><a href='/?view=agents'><span aria-hidden='true'>⌁</span><span>Bots</span></a><a href='/knowledge'><span aria-hidden='true'>▤</span><span>Knowledge</span></a><a href='/?view=rooms'><span aria-hidden='true'>#</span><span>Rooms</span></a><a href='/?view=tools'><span aria-hidden='true'>⊞</span><span>Tools</span></a><a href='/dna'><span aria-hidden='true'>◈</span><span>DNA</span></a><a href='/personas'><span aria-hidden='true'>◇</span><span>Personas</span></a><a href='/?view=monitor'><span aria-hidden='true'>▥</span><span>Usage</span></a><a href='/?view=manage' aria-current='location'><span aria-hidden='true'>⚙</span><span>Manage</span></a></nav>
  <div class="sidebar-bottom"><div class="profile"><span class="avatar">OP</span><div>Operator<small>Local access</small></div></div></div>
</aside>
<div class="shell">
  <header><div class="header-left"><a class="new-chat-link" href="/dms?new=1"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>New DM</a><span class="header-context">Manage<span class='slash' aria-hidden='true'>/</span>Permissions</span></div><div class="header-right"><a class='discuss-page' href='/dms?discuss=authority'>Discuss design ↗</a><a class="node-link" href="/?view=nodes"><span class="node-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></span>Local</a></div></header>
  <div class="body-grid with-section-nav"><aside class='section-navigation'><h2>Manage</h2><nav aria-label='Manage'><a href='/?view=nodes'>Nodes</a><a href='/?view=authority' aria-current='page'>Permissions</a><a href='/?view=providers'>Models &amp; providers</a><a href='/?view=discord-access'>Discord access</a><a href='/?view=integrations'>Integrations</a></nav></aside><main><h2>Permissions</h2><p class='muted'>Strict and off by default. Requests wait for a decision unless the automatic approval policy below takes them; the other settings only choose who else may decide.</p><form class='decision-form permissions' method='post' action='/manage/permissions'><fieldset><legend>Automatic approval</legend><label><input type='radio' name='auto_mode' value='strict' checked> Strict (everything asks)</label><label><input type='radio' name='auto_mode' value='auto'> Auto (routine requests within scope)</label><p class='muted'>Strict: every port and bot request waits for you. Auto: routine requests inside a task's scope are approved at once by the rules below, recorded with the policy as decider and shown under Auto-approved recently; anything else still asks.</p><label>Network ports<select name='auto_port'><option value='auto' selected>Auto within the rules</option><option value='ask'>Always ask</option></select></label><label>Persistent bots<select name='auto_bot'><option value='auto' selected>Auto within the rules</option><option value='ask'>Always ask</option></select></label><p class='muted'>Folder access (host files) and anything involving credentials always ask; there is no automatic option.</p><label>Standing egress targets (host:port, one per line)<textarea name='standing_targets' rows='3' placeholder='127.0.0.1:25565'></textarea></label><p class='muted'>Without a listed target, ports are automatic only for public host names on 80 or 443, routes between the task's own services and ingress above 1024 on host loopback. Loopback, private-network and link-local targets always ask unless listed here.</p><label><input type='checkbox' name='auto_notices' value='yes' checked> Send a notice for each automatic decision</label><p class='muted'>Rate-limited FYI notices through your messaging channels; no action needed.</p><p class='muted'>Always ask for tasks of:</p><label><input type='checkbox' name='strict_local' value='yes'> Local operator (this host, TUI, chat MCP)</label></fieldset><fieldset><legend>The chat MCP (<code>control mcp --chat</code>) may decide</legend><label><input type='checkbox' name='mcp_folder' value='yes'> Folder access (/open: host paths)</label><label><input type='checkbox' name='mcp_port' value='yes'> Network ports</label><label><input type='checkbox' name='mcp_bot' value='yes'> Persistent bots</label><label><input type='checkbox' name='mcp_question' value='yes'> Design questions</label><label><input type='checkbox' name='mcp_knowledge' value='yes'> Knowledge proposals</label><p class='muted'>An external agent with these on can approve its own run's requests. It already acts as you, so this is a policy for the bridge, not a security boundary.</p></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Control agents</legend><label><input type='checkbox' name='agent_chat_tools' value='yes'> Agents may use the chat tools (control_chat) to drive DMs in their own task</label><p class='muted'>Agents see and change only their own task, never decide requests and spend your model quota.</p></fieldset><button>Save</button></form><h3 class='form-title'>Running now</h3><div class='metrics'><div><b>1</b><span>SERVICES</span></div><div><b>1</b><span>OPEN PORTS</span></div><div><b>0</b><span>BOTS</span></div></div><article class='record'><h3>Services</h3><p>svc-a · Running · sleep 300 · <a href='/dm/c-100-0'>Zulu</a></p></article><article class='record'><h3>Ports</h3><p>echo · Service :31000 → 127.0.0.1:31001 · Pending <span class='tag'>auto · public-web</span></p><p class='muted'><a href='/tools/ports'>Revoke on the TCP ports page ↗</a></p></article><article class='record'><h3>Bots</h3><p class='muted'>No persistent bots.</p><p class='muted'>Stop a bot with /bot off in its DM.</p></article><h3 class='form-title'>Auto-approved recently</h3><article class='record'><p><span class='tag'>port</span> egress &lt;example.org&gt;:443 · rule public-web · <a href='/dm/c-100-0'>Zulu</a> · 2027-01-15 08:00 UTC</p></article><h3 class='form-title'>Waiting on you</h3><article class='record'><span class='tag'>question</span><h3>Decision requested</h3><p>Which format? &lt;script&gt;

1. Plain text
2. JSON (recommended)

Reply with a number or your own direction. For this question: /answer q-b9033804c3a3ad3795f957128d05206d YOUR_ANSWER</p><p class='muted'><a href='/dm/c-100-0'>Zulu ↗</a></p></article><article class='record'><span class='tag'>port</span><h3>Port request · echo · {&quot;host&quot;:&quot;127.0.0.1&quot;,&quot;port&quot;:31001}</h3><p class='muted'><a href='/dm/c-100-0'>Zulu ↗</a></p></article><article class='record'><span class='tag'>bot</span><h3>Bot request · Zulu (c-100-0)</h3><p class='muted'><a href='/dm/c-100-0'>Zulu ↗</a></p></article><article class='record'><span class='tag'>folder</span><h3>Folder request · /srv/&lt;data&gt; (c-100-0)</h3><p class='muted'><a href='/dm/c-100-0'>Zulu ↗</a></p></article><article class='record'><span class='tag'>knowledge</span><h3>Knowledge proposal · c-100-0</h3><p>Builds need &lt;nix&gt;
Evidence: The flake &amp; lock
Scope: This node
Recheck when: When the flake changes</p><p class='muted'><a href='/dm/c-100-0'>Zulu ↗</a></p></article><span class='eyebrow'>ACCESS</span><h2>Access requests</h2><p class='muted'>Preview only: decisions are recorded but do not grant access or run tools.</p><div class='empty'>No pending requests.</div><h3 class='form-title'>New request</h3><form method='post' action='/request'><label>Capability<select name='capability'><option>network.read</option><option>environment.package</option><option>tool.access</option></select></label><label>Domain, package, or tool<input name='resource' required maxlength='300'></label><label>Why is it needed?<input name='purpose' required maxlength='500'></label><label>Reviewer<select name='authority'><option value='human'>Human operator</option><option value='judge'>Judge · not connected</option></select></label><button class='primary'>Submit request ↗</button></form><div class="bottom-note"><span>⌘ CONTROL</span></div></main></div>
</div>
</body></html>
